                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "776b5c26-98b8-32d8-bfed-0a81379000f2",
                        "entry_id": "077c4e4d-8191-3f23-8d74-7f1114b8a1ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who tells the truth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b534124-9dda-4e82-aecf-9d818dd52299",
                                "sense_id": "776b5c26-98b8-32d8-bfed-0a81379000f2",
                                "text": "A liar can't begin to start the riots a truther can."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8cdb746a-57f8-36df-985d-a5f7deefd307",
                        "entry_id": "077c4e4d-8191-3f23-8d74-7f1114b8a1ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who believes that the US government was responsible for the 9/11 attacks."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6d688df-d29c-49b2-a2fb-64fe4534c44c",
                                "sense_id": "8cdb746a-57f8-36df-985d-a5f7deefd307",
                                "text": "[signed] 9/11 Truther"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba2e9702-47fe-4da9-982b-68b4d261c2a5",
                                "sense_id": "8cdb746a-57f8-36df-985d-a5f7deefd307",
                                "text": "Therefore, virtually every press release or statement about 9/11 should include a reference to the poll to show people that many Americans are 9/11 truthers who scoff at the 9/11 Commission as a fraud and that demand a real 9/11 investigation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a335833b-e57a-403c-bd95-3c01ebc01a99",
                                "sense_id": "8cdb746a-57f8-36df-985d-a5f7deefd307",
                                "text": "The Iranian president is even a \"truther,\" insisting that there was a hidden hand behind Sept. 11, 2001. \"Could it be planned and executed without coordination with intelligence and security services — or their extensive infiltration?\" he mused in the letter to Bush."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cfee7ef7-d6f4-32c1-8516-54236b3147a3",
                        "entry_id": "077c4e4d-8191-3f23-8d74-7f1114b8a1ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A conspiracy theorist who does not believe the accepted story about some significant event, fact, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87690f5c-5fe2-499c-849b-1a4af4a14224",
                                "sense_id": "cfee7ef7-d6f4-32c1-8516-54236b3147a3",
                                "text": "For instance, \"truthers\" who believe in a US government conspiracy to destroy the pentagon"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77201e2d-c2e5-40f2-a691-596c70e4b330",
                                "sense_id": "cfee7ef7-d6f4-32c1-8516-54236b3147a3",
                                "text": "Rather, believers of this conspiracy theory (known as Sandy Hook “truthers”) propose that the entire event might have been staged by Homeland Security and FEMA"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4876dd02-0342-485d-8218-15493d384e1c",
                                "sense_id": "cfee7ef7-d6f4-32c1-8516-54236b3147a3",
                                "text": "I am calling your attention to it because I think that we JFK truthers may be able to use this film to our advantage."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
